# UIR-12 ArenaScreen 1:1 — evidence log

Wave: post-approval selection-screens wave (UIR-10 → UIR-11 → UIR-12), single screen worker.
Repo: `/Users/lucafantini/Desktop/Personal/Padel-3D/steam-circuit-padel-godot`, commit `6343312`.
UIR-12 depends on UIR-11 (characters routes here); both landed, in order.

